**Logical Relationships**

- **G1** → G2, G3, G4, G5, G6, G8 [AND][;]  
- **G5** → G5.1, G5.2 [OR][FALLBACK(G5.1,G5.2)]  
- **G5.2** → G5.2.1, G5.2.2, G5.2.3, G5.2.4 [OR][FALLBACK(G5.2.1,FALLBACK(G5.2.2,FALLBACK(G5.2.3,G5.2.4))]  
- **G6** → G6.1, G6.2, G6.3 [OR][FALLBACK(G6.1,FALLBACK(G6.2,G6.3))]  
- **G8** → G8.1, G8.2, G8.3 [OR][FALLBACK(G8.1,FALLBACK(G8.2,G8.3))]  

Each task is linked to its parent goal with an **AND** relation, indicating that all tasks under a goal must be performed for the goal to be satisfied.
